WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:07.000
We are sitting here in what used to be Kfar Aza’s neighborhood for young families. What should happen to this place?

00:08.800 --> 00:10.333
We don't know yet.

00:10.333 --> 00:12.066
We are waiting for them,

00:13.166 --> 00:14.766
we want them back,

00:14.766 --> 00:20.500
not just them, there is another 46 people,

00:22.866 --> 00:25.800
A part of them lives, the others, not.

00:30.866 --> 00:34.266
We will not decide about this area

00:34.266 --> 00:36.000
until they will be back.

00:36.000 --> 00:37.666
I'll show you later on,

00:37.933 --> 00:39.800
you can take a picture of trees,

00:40.500 --> 00:42.066
a part of the new...

00:43.133 --> 00:46.033
the neighborhood was already fixed,

00:46.300 --> 00:51.533
there is part of it that is not fixed.

00:51.533 --> 00:53.400
Because we have

00:54.266 --> 00:59.666
a Jewish tradition that we are keeping a little bit

00:59.666 --> 01:02.066
of the wall not finished,

01:02.066 --> 01:05.400
until the Beit HaMikdash, the temple,

01:05.400 --> 01:08.566
will be rebuilt again.

01:08.566 --> 01:09.766
So we did it,

01:10.000 --> 01:15.266
and we will fix it just after all the 48 people will be back.

01:16.333 --> 01:19.500
And this neighborhood,

01:20.133 --> 01:22.000
we will decide what to do with it,

01:22.000 --> 01:24.900
just after Gali and Ziv will be back.

01:25.900 --> 01:27.200
Talia is waiting,

01:27.200 --> 01:28.466
Talia, the mother

01:29.166 --> 01:32.133
and Doron and the two brothers.

01:32.133 --> 01:37.700
I'm talking with them a lot and

01:39.733 --> 01:40.600
they're waiting.

01:46.333 --> 01:49.000
I don't know if you saw my wife,

01:49.000 --> 01:53.566
my wife is a lot in the media.

01:54.100 --> 01:55.900
She's a famous, not like me,

01:56.733 --> 02:00.433
and always with a shirt of Gali and Ziv (Berman),

02:00.433 --> 02:02.733
or Omri (Miran) from Nahal Oz,

02:02.733 --> 02:06.066
our neighbors, or something else.

02:07.166 --> 02:11.433
We are living around those 48 people,

02:13.533 --> 02:15.000
we're doing everything

02:16.466 --> 02:21.800
that no one will forget them over there.

02:23.366 --> 02:25.000
This is our job now.
